    <briefdescription>
<para>GPU kernel execution manager with move semantics support. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 BETA </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Gap Categories: CWE-457 (uninitialized variable), CWE-415 (double-free), CWE-672 (use-after-free)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RAII-based GPU kernel resource management</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Move constructors/assignment operators with noexcept guarantees</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Proper moved-from state validation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>GPU resource cleanup via std::unique_ptr</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>ThemisDB Remediation Roadmap: Sprint 8 Phase 1C </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
